description.text:
How to turn the <b>depth channel</b> into the distance between the camera and an object:

@b;direct@n	Z directly controls blur
@b;depth@n	Z is distance in front of camera.
@b;far=0@n	Z is 1/distance (Nuke, RMan)
@b;far=1@n	near plane = 0, far plane = 1 (OpenGL)
@b;-direct@n	Same as direct with occlusion reversed
@b;-depth@n	Z is -distance in front of camera.
@b;far=-0@n	Z is -1/distance (Maya)
@b;far=-1@n	near plane = 0, far plane = -1
